  "solution": {
    "text": "For first order reaction $\\mathrm{t}_{1 / 2}=\\frac{\\ell \\mathrm{n} 2}{\\mathrm{k}}$\n\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/DH6NCmbR_FZZ27YdkgZxUvvwqnQHTln86y4S8_HyuPE.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\nFor first order reaction\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\log \\frac{[R]_0}{[R]}=\\frac{1}{2.303} \\mathrm{kt} \\\\\n& \\log \\frac{[\\mathrm{R}]_0}{[\\mathrm{R}]}=\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{2.303}\\right) \\times \\mathrm{t}\n\\end{aligned}$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/jOX6ZyJ2tnr3jL4irMAWnHe2wMZ6oetL9fM6fJiBD2w.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
